			"Message": "build(Sky): Inject Tier* environment variables into import.meta.env at build time\n\nAdd a Vite `define` configuration in astro.config.ts that maps all environment variables prefixed with \"Tier\" to `import.meta.env.Tier*`. This ensures Wind's Utility/Tier.ts sees the same Tier configuration values that Cocoon receives, enabling consistent tier-based feature flags across the application.\n\nVite performs the substitution at build time; missing environment variables fall through to the PascalCase defaults defined in Utility/Tier.ts.",
